         {	
            "commonName": "Panel",
            "name": "BagianInfo",
            "alignV": "CENTER",
            "alignH": "LEFT",
            "marginLeft": 100,
            "marginTop": -15,
            "width": 600,
            "height": 300,
            "children":
            [
                {
                    "commonName": "Panel",
                    "name": "Info1",
                    "alignV": "FILL",
                    "alignH": "FILL",
                    "bindings":
                    [
                        {
                            "binding": "bnd_tab1_visible",
                            "property": "visible"
                        }
                    ],
                    "children":
                    [
                        {
                            "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": -50,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Extended-Heavy",
                            "fontSize": 30,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "text": "Assistant Coach"
                        },
                        {
                        "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": -40,
                            "marginLeft": 720,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 15,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "text": "Friday 11:24 AM"
                        },
                        {
                            "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": -10,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "My name is Sir Antony, and I am delighted to officially join your backroom staff as part of your coaching team. My primary role will be to assist you in refining our tactical approach, analyzing upcoming opponents, and providing key suggestions to maximize our squad's potential. Both myself and the rest of the staff are thrilled to have you leading this project, and we are fully committed to supporting you in achieving long-term success at the club."
                            },
                        {
                        "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 110,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "After evaluating our squad depth, I strongly recommend investing in a promising young left-back or center-back. Securing a future star now will ensure a smooth transition when our current defenders begin to decline."
                            },
                        {
                        "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 270,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "I look forward to collaborating with you and helping this club reach new heights. Don't hesitate to reach out if you need any additional analysis or suggestions."
                            },
                        {
                        "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 330,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 145,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "Best Regards"
                            },
                        {
                            "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 190,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "Regarding player development, our striker's performance data shows room for improvement in long-range shooting, through passes, and volleys. Implementing focused training on these specific areas could significantly boost his contributions on the pitch."
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "commonName": "Panel",
                    "name": "Info2",
                    "alignV": "FILL",
                    "alignH": "FILL",
                    "bindings":
                    [
                        {
                            "binding": "bnd_tab2_visible",
                            "property": "visible"
                        }
                    ],
                    "children":
                    [
                        {
                            "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": -50,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Extended-Heavy",
                            "fontSize": 30,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "text": "Sport Director"
                        },
                        {
                        "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": -40,
                            "marginLeft": 690,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 15,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "text": "Today 5:54 PM"
                        },
                        {
                            "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": -10,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "My name is Sir Noguera, your Sports Director. It will be my responsibility to monitor our progress and ensure we achieve success in the league. The entire organization is thrilled to welcome you, and we're confident you can lead us to another league title."
                            },
                        {
                        "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 70,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "Before we begin, I want to highlight our recent achievements: We've been crowned champions 3 times in the last 5 years. This club expects excellence, and we trust you'll continue this winning tradition during your tenure."
                            },
                        {
                            "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 150,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "Now, let me outline the board's key objectives:"
                            },
                        {
                            "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 180,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "Domestic Success: Secure a top 6 finish to qualify for European competitions and generate additional revenue."
                            },
                        {
                        "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 300,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "These goals will provide the necessary funds to upgrade facilities and strengthen our squad. I'll be available to discuss strategies for meeting these targets."
                            },
                        {
                        "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 360,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "Welcome aboard. Together, we'll write another successful chapter for this club."
                            },
                        {
                            "commonName": "Label",
                            "alignV": "TOP",
                            "alignH": "LEFT",
                            "marginTop": 240,
                            "marginLeft": 400,
                            "fontFace": "$CruyffSans-Regular",
                            "fontSize": 20,
                            "fontColor": "$COLOR_WHITE",
                            "width": 800,
                            "multiline": true,
                            "leading": 1,
                            "alpha": 1,
                            "text": "Financial Targets: Generate €35M+ through_ ticket sales, merchandise, sponsorships, and player transactions."
                        }
                    ]
